  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_system_01",
      "hash64": "E9778D61F010DAE0",
      "text": "Zwischen all den Haushaltswaren liegt ein\\nverstaubter Gegenstand.\\c\\nEr verströmt einen extrem süßlichen Geruch.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_system_02",
      "hash64": "E9779061F010DFF9",
      "text": "Hat sich da nicht eben etwas bewegt?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_system_03",
      "hash64": "E9778F61F010DE46",
      "text": "*brrring-rrring*",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_01",
      "hash64": "A84FD78B63CAAC2F",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Hi, ich bin’s, Pepper![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_02",
      "hash64": "A84FD88B63CAADE2",
      "text": "Mir ist da so einiges zu Ohren gekommen. Erst\\neine Exkursion und dann ein Schüleraustausch...\\c\\nDu hast ja ein ganz schönes Abenteuer\\nhinter dir, was?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 151,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_select_01",
      "hash64": "BF719182D239233B",
      "text": "Ja, es war klasse!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_select_02",
      "hash64": "BF719282D23924EE",
      "text": "Ach, war nichts Besonderes...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_03",
      "hash64": "A84FD98B63CAAF95",
      "text": "Echt? Mann, ich wär total gern dabei gewesen![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_04",
      "hash64": "A84FD28B63CAA3B0",
      "text": "Komm schon, das meinst du doch nicht ernst!\\nBei mir musst du nicht so cool tun.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_05",
      "hash64": "A84FD38B63CAA563",
      "text": "Schon krass, was alles passiert, seit du an\\nunsere Akademie gekommen bist...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_06",
      "hash64": "A84FD48B63CAA716",
      "text": "Wie sieht’s denn gerade bei dir aus, hast du\\nnoch viel um die Ohren?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_07",
      "hash64": "A84FD58B63CAA8C9",
      "text": "Falls du Zeit und Lust hast...\\nAlso wirklich nur, wenn du willst! Äh...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_08",
      "hash64": "A84FDE8B63CAB814",
      "text": "Ich dachte mir, ich könnte ja mal bei dir zu Hause\\nreinschneien?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_select_03",
      "hash64": "BF719382D23926A1",
      "text": "Klar, komm ruhig vorbei!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_select_04",
      "hash64": "BF719482D2392854",
      "text": "Aus einem bestimmten Grund?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_09",
      "hash64": "A84FDF8B63CAB9C7",
      "text": "Wirklich?! Cool! Das ging ja leichter als gedacht.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_10",
      "hash64": "A8535C8B63CDC405",
      "text": "N-Nö, einfach so! Beste Freunde besuchen sich\\nab und zu gegenseitig zu Hause, oder?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_11",
      "hash64": "A8535B8B63CDC252",
      "text": "Gut, dann ist es entschieden![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_12",
      "hash64": "A8535A8B63CDC09F",
      "text": "Du wohnst in Cucharico, richtig?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_side01_0000_friend_13",
      "hash64": "A853598B63CDBEEC",
      "text": "Ich treff dich dann vor deiner Haustür.\\nBis später![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
